    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Rebuilt in 2026, this exceptional A rated detached family home offers a balanced mix of contemporary design, premium comfort, and outstanding energy efficiency. The property features five generously sized bedrooms, including a ground floor bedroom and a master suite complete with private en suite.\r\nConstructed and finished to an exceptional standard, the home benefits from air to water heating, heat recovery ventilation, triple glazed windows, and full alarm wiring, ensuring optimal performance, security, and year round comfort.\r\nthe property is further enhanced by a detached garage, offering excellent storage or workshop potential. This turnkey residence delivers spacious accommodation, high quality finishes, and superior energy credentials in a highly desirable setting—ideal for modern family living."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "MEASUREMENTS & DETAILS\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall (5m x 2m)\r\nWood effect tiles, oak and white staircase to first floor, recessed stair lights, internet and telephone point, under-stair storage\r\n\r\nLiving Room (4.7m x 3.05m)\r\nWood floor, wired for media wall, data cable\r\n\r\nKitchen (5.95m x 3.7m)\r\nWood effect tiles, recessed lights, shaker style eye and low-level units, island unit, drainer sink, microwave press, integrated Whirlpool fridge-freezer, Candy electric oven, extractor over induction hob, integrated dishwasher, LED lights on kick-boards\r\n\r\nUtility (2.8m x 1.6m)\r\nWood effect tiles, eye and low-level units\r\n\r\nW/C/Toilet (1.5m x 1.5m)\r\nTwo-piece suite\r\n\r\nDownstairs Bedroom (4.7mx 3.05m)\r\nTiled floor, room stat\r\n\r\nWardrobe (1m x 0.9m)\r\n\r\nMaster Bedroom (4.6m x 3.7m) Front \r\nWood floor, data point, phone point, TV point, room stat, smoke alarm\r\n\r\nEnsuite (2.4m x1.55m)\r\nFully tiled, two-piece suite, mixer shower\r\n\r\nBedroom (3.7m x 3.05m) Front \r\nWood floor, data point, TV point, room stat\r\n\r\nBedroom (4.05m x 3.4m) \r\nWood floor, TV point, room stat, smoke alarm\r\n\r\nBedroom (3.8m x 3m) \r\nWood floor, TV point, room stat, smoke alarm\r\n\r\nBathroom 3(2.5m x 2.2m) \r\nFully tiled, three-piece suite incl. bath, mixer shower\r\n\r\nGarage (5.6m x 4.2m)\r\nRemote roller door"
      },
